PTX mbarrier-init+no-fence+cluster-barrier
"As mbarrier-init+op-restrict+cluster-barrier without the fence: the relaxed cluster barrier gives no ordering, P1's arrive may read the location before the initialization, which is undefined behaviour (9.7.13.15.10, D7): every outcome is allowed, even this impossible one. Expected: allowed."
{
b=mbarrier() @cta 0;
P1:r0=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0       | P1@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0                              ;
 mbarrier.init.shared::cta b, 2 | barrier.cluster.arrive.relaxed                        ;
 barrier.cluster.arrive.relaxed | barrier.cluster.wait                                  ;
 barrier.cluster.wait           | mbarrier.arrive.release.cluster.shared::cluster r0, b ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 7)
